{"audio": "james-02.opus", "duration_ms": 183245, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2120, "end_ms": 3300, "text": "James, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 4561, "end_ms": 10341, "text": "My brothers, as you hold out your faith in our glorious Lord Jesus Christ, do not show favoritism."}, {"start_ms": 10941, "end_ms": 18102, "text": "Suppose a man comes into your meeting wearing a gold ring and fine clothes, and a poor man in shabby clothes also comes in."}, {"start_ms": 18903, "end_ms": 33065, "text": "If you lavish attention on the man in fine clothes and say, “Here is a seat of honor,” but say to the poor man, “You must stand” or “Sit at my feet,” have you not discriminated among yourselves and become judges with evil thoughts?"}, {"start_ms": 34025, "end_ms": 41946, "text": "Listen, my beloved brothers: Has not God chosen the poor of this world to be rich in faith and to inherit the kingdom He promised those who love Him?"}, {"start_ms": 42746, "end_ms": 44226, "text": "But you have dishonored the poor."}, {"start_ms": 44846, "end_ms": 47767, "text": "Is it not the rich who oppress you and drag you into court?"}, {"start_ms": 48327, "end_ms": 52307, "text": "Are they not the ones who blaspheme the noble name by which you have been called?"}, {"start_ms": 53067, "end_ms": 59208, "text": "If you really fulfill the royal law stated in Scripture, “Love your neighbor as yourself,” you are doing well."}, {"start_ms": 59828, "end_ms": 64989, "text": "But if you show favoritism, you sin and are convicted by the law as transgressors."}, {"start_ms": 66009, "end_ms": 71290, "text": "Whoever keeps the whole law but stumbles at just one point is guilty of breaking all of it."}, {"start_ms": 72050, "end_ms": 81771, "text": "For He who said, “Do not commit adultery,” also said, “Do not murder.” If you do not commit adultery, but do commit murder, you have become a lawbreaker."}, {"start_ms": 82811, "end_ms": 87172, "text": "Speak and act as those who are going to be judged by the law that gives freedom."}, {"start_ms": 87812, "end_ms": 92133, "text": "For judgment without mercy will be shown to anyone who has not been merciful."}, {"start_ms": 92573, "end_ms": 94493, "text": "Mercy triumphs over judgment."}, {"start_ms": 95453, "end_ms": 100054, "text": "What good is it, my brothers, if someone claims to have faith, but has no deeds?"}, {"start_ms": 100474, "end_ms": 101954, "text": "Can such faith save him?"}, {"start_ms": 102674, "end_ms": 106274, "text": "Suppose a brother or sister is without clothes and daily food."}, {"start_ms": 107055, "end_ms": 114636, "text": "If one of you tells him, “Go in peace; stay warm and well fed,” but does not provide for his physical needs, what good is that?"}, {"start_ms": 115356, "end_ms": 119916, "text": "So too, faith by itself, if it does not result in action, is dead."}, {"start_ms": 120576, "end_ms": 128097, "text": "But someone will say, “You have faith and I have deeds.” Show me your faith without deeds, and I will show you my faith by my deeds."}, {"start_ms": 128738, "end_ms": 130198, "text": "You believe that God is one."}, {"start_ms": 130658, "end_ms": 131158, "text": "Good for you!"}, {"start_ms": 131698, "end_ms": 134258, "text": "Even the demons believe that—and shudder."}, {"start_ms": 135418, "end_ms": 139239, "text": "O foolish man, do you want evidence that faith without deeds is worthless?"}, {"start_ms": 139759, "end_ms": 145060, "text": "Was not our father Abraham justified by what he did when he offered his son Isaac on the altar?"}, {"start_ms": 145900, "end_ms": 151241, "text": "You see that his faith was working with his actions, and his faith was perfected by what he did."}, {"start_ms": 152101, "end_ms": 160942, "text": "And the Scripture was fulfilled that says, “Abraham believed God, and it was credited to him as righteousness,” and he was called a friend of God."}, {"start_ms": 161942, "end_ms": 167043, "text": "As you can see, a man is justified by his deeds and not by faith alone."}, {"start_ms": 168043, "end_ms": 176304, "text": "In the same way, was not even Rahab the prostitute justified by her actions when she welcomed the spies and sent them off on another route?"}, {"start_ms": 177084, "end_ms": 181705, "text": "As the body without the spirit is dead, so faith without deeds is dead."}], "words": [{"t": "James,", "s": 2120, "e": 2540, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2680, "e": 3020, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 3100, "e": 3300, "si": 0}, {"t": "My", "s": 4561, "e": 4681, "si": 1}, {"t": "brothers,", "s": 4741, "e": 5161, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 5381, "e": 5481, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 5541, "e": 5621, "si": 1}, {"t": "hold", "s": 5721, "e": 5941, "si": 1}, {"t": "out", "s": 5981, "e": 6121, "si": 1}, {"t": "your", "s": 6161, "e": 6281, "si": 1}, {"t": "faith", "s": 6341, "e": 6601, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6661, "e": 6741, "si": 1}, {"t": "our", "s": 6781, "e": 6901, "si": 1}, {"t": "glorious", "s": 6961, "e": 7421, "si": 1}, {"t": "Lord", "s": 7521, "e": 7721, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus", "s": 7761, "e": 8101, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ,", "s": 8161, "e": 8541, "si": 1}, {"t": "do", "s": 8881, "e": 8941, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 9101, "e": 9321, "si": 1}, {"t": "show", "s": 9401, "e": 9561, "si": 1}, {"t": "favoritism.", "s": 9681, "e": 10341, "si": 1}, {"t": "Suppose", "s": 10941, "e": 11322, "si": 2}, {"t": "a", "s": 11362, "e": 11382, "si": 2}, {"t": "man", "s": 11422, "e": 11622, "si": 2}, {"t": "comes", "s": 11722, "e": 11982, "si": 2}, {"t": "into", "s": 12042, "e": 12222, "si": 2}, {"t": "your", "s": 12262, "e": 12382, "si": 2}, {"t": "meeting", "s": 12402, "e": 12702, "si": 2}, {"t": "wearing", "s": 12782, "e": 13062, "si": 2}, {"t": "a", "s": 13122, "e": 13142, "si": 2}, {"t": "gold", "s": 13262, "e": 13542, "si": 2}, {"t": "ring", "s": 13642, "e": 13842, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 13882, "e": 13982, "si": 2}, {"t": "fine", "s": 14082, "e": 14402, "si": 2}, {"t": "clothes,", "s": 14462, "e": 14902, "si": 2}, {"t": "a